      "start": 0.826,
      "end": 2.951,
      "sourceText": "学校里人真多啊！",
      "sourcePinyin": "Xuéxiào li rén zhēn duō a!"
    },
    {
      "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l02:text2:line2",
      "kind": "lines",
      "track": "course-assets/hsk2/audio/2-3.mp3",
      "sourceHash": "cad4cfb02960688db0ad9dfece05db7a7d774c24944b35cece126a599e649139",
      "start": 3.753,
      "end": 7.926,
      "sourceText": "是啊，北京大学有四万多名学生呢！",
      "sourcePinyin": "Shì a, Běijīng Dàxué yǒu sìwàn duō míng xuésheng ne!"
    },
    {
      "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l02:text2:line3",
      "kind": "lines",
      "track": "course-assets/hsk2/audio/2-3.mp3",
      "sourceHash": "cad4cfb02960688db0ad9dfece05db7a7d774c24944b35cece126a599e649139",
      "start": 9.097,
      "end": 10.557,
      "sourceText": "你是怎么知道的？",
      "sourcePinyin": "Nǐ shì zěnme zhīdào de?"
    },
    {
      "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l02:text2:line4",
      "kind": "lines",
      "track": "course-assets/hsk2/audio/2-3.mp3",
      "sourceHash": "cad4cfb02960688db0ad9dfece05db7a7d774c24944b35cece126a599e649139",
      "start": 11.343,
      "end": 18.456,
      "sourceText": "是网上说的，网上还说北京大学有三千多名外国学生。",
      "sourcePinyin": "Shì wǎngshang shuō de, wǎngshang hái shuō Běijīng Dàxué yǒu sānqiān duō míng wàiguó xuésheng."
    },
    {
      "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l02:text2:line5",
      "kind": "lines",
      "track": "course-assets/hsk2/audio/2-3.mp3",
      "sourceHash": "cad4cfb02960688db0ad9dfece05db7a7d774c24944b35cece126a599e649139",
      "start": 19.439,
      "end": 21.415,
      "sourceText": "我也想来这儿学习。",
      "sourcePinyin": "Wǒ yě xiǎng lái zhèr xuéxí."
    },
    {
      "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l02:text2:line6",
      "kind": "lines",
      "track": "course-assets/hsk2/audio/2-3.mp3",
      "sourceHash": "cad4cfb02960688db0ad9dfece05db7a7d774c24944b35cece126a599e649139",
      "start": 22.736,
      "end": 26.418,
      "sourceText": "那边就有一间教室，我们去看一下吧。",
      "sourcePinyin": "Nàbian jiù yǒu yì jiān jiàoshì, wǒmen qù kàn yíxià ba."
    },
    {
      "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l02:text3:line1",
      "kind": "lines",
      "track": "course-assets/hsk2/audio/2-5.mp3",
      "sourceHash": "9ad1cb08fdbc7201ebf19f3241c3dd81e38cc5786bdf45a525cfce91c7b434ea",
      "start": 0.453,
      "end": 4.629,
      "sourceText": "家月，你看，学校里有家电影院！",
      "sourcePinyin": "Jiāyuè, nǐ kàn, xuéxiào li yǒu jiā diànyǐngyuàn!"
    },
    {
      "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l02:text3:line2",
      "kind": "lines",
      "track": "course-assets/hsk2/audio/2-5.mp3",
      "sourceHash": "9ad1cb08fdbc7201ebf19f3241c3dd81e38cc5786bdf45a525cfce91c7b434ea",
      "start": 5.509,
      "end": 8.499,
      "sourceText": "是啊，电影院还不小。",
      "sourcePinyin": "Shì a, diànyǐngyuàn hái bù xiǎo."
    },
    {
      "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l02:text3:line3",
      "kind": "lines",
      "track": "course-assets/hsk2/audio/2-5.mp3",
      "sourceHash": "9ad1cb08fdbc7201ebf19f3241c3dd81e38cc5786bdf45a525cfce91c7b434ea",
      "start": 9.356,
      "end": 12.277,
      "sourceText": "他们卖的电影票也很便宜。",
      "sourcePinyin": "Tāmen mài de diànyǐngpiào yě hěn piányi."
    },
    {
      "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l02:text3:line4",
      "kind": "lines",
      "track": "course-assets/hsk2/audio/2-5.mp3",
      "sourceHash": "9ad1cb08fdbc7201ebf19f3241c3dd81e38cc5786bdf45a525cfce91c7b434ea",
      "start": 13.315,
      "end": 16.622,
      "sourceText": "天啊！有的还不到二十块钱。",
      "sourcePinyin": "Tiān a! Yǒude hái bú dào èrshí kuài qián."
    },
    {
      "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l02:text3:line5",
      "kind": "lines",
      "track": "course-assets/hsk2/audio/2-5.mp3",
      "sourceHash": "9ad1cb08fdbc7201ebf19f3241c3dd81e38cc5786bdf45a525cfce91c7b434ea",
      "start": 17.518,
      "end": 20.32,
      "sourceText": "那你想不想去看个电影？",
      "sourcePinyin": "Nà nǐ xiǎng bu xiǎng qù kàn ge diànyǐng?"
    },
    {
      "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l02:text3:line6",
      "kind": "lines",
      "track": "course-assets/hsk2/audio/2-5.mp3",
      "sourceHash": "9ad1cb08fdbc7201ebf19f3241c3dd81e38cc5786bdf45a525cfce91c7b434ea",
      "start": 21.871,
      "end": 26.009,
      "sourceText": "还是别看电影了，北京大学就很好看！",
      "sourcePinyin": "Háishi bié kàn diànyǐng le, Běijīng Dàxué jiù hěn hǎokàn!"
    },
    {
      "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l02:text4:line1",
      "kind": "lines",
      "track": "course-assets/hsk2/audio/2-7.mp3",
      "sourceHash": "d15ac004b92205234b2a65134628a1e58426386cffcb067fc5a0a244d9824c8f",
      "start": 0.788,
      "end": 14.665,
      "sourceText": "北京大学很大，有四万多名学生。学校很漂亮，里边还有家电影院，电影票也不贵，我们有时间还想再过来看个电影。",
      "sourcePinyin": "Běijīng Dàxué hěn dà, yǒu sìwàn duō míng xuésheng. Xuéxiào hěn piàoliang, lǐbian hái yǒu jiā diànyǐngyuàn, diànyǐngpiào yě bú guì, wǒmen yǒu shíjiān hái xiǎng zài guòlái kàn ge diànyǐng."
    },
    {
      "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l03:text1:line1",
      "kind": "lines",
      "track": "course-assets/hsk2/audio/3-1.mp3",
      "sourceHash": "a5266364b94e2f1164829ca370f4d844731a2e4de32882c820116c28126ec328",
      "start": 0.915,
      "end": 2.64,
      "sourceText": "今天回来这么晚啊！",
      "sourcePinyin": "Jīntiān huílái zhème wǎn a!"
    },
    {
      "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l03:text1:line2",
      "kind": "lines",
      "track": "course-assets/hsk2/audio/3-1.mp3",
      "sourceHash": "a5266364b94e2f1164829ca370f4d844731a2e4de32882c820116c28126ec328",
      "start": 3.379,
      "end": 7.151,
      "sourceText": "工作太多了，下班的时候没做完。",
      "sourcePinyin": "Gōngzuò tài duō le, xiàbān de shíhou méi zuòwán."
    },
    {
      "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l03:text1:line3",
      "kind": "lines",
      "track": "course-assets/hsk2/audio/3-1.mp3",
      "sourceHash": "a5266364b94e2f1164829ca370f4d844731a2e4de32882c820116c28126ec328",
      "start": 8.186,
      "end": 11.095,
      "sourceText": "菜都做好了，过来吃饭吧。",
      "sourcePinyin": "Cài dōu zuòhǎo le, guòlái chī fàn ba."
    },
    {
      "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l03:text1:line4",
      "kind": "lines",
      "track": "course-assets/hsk2/audio/3-1.mp3",
      "sourceHash": "a5266364b94e2f1164829ca370f4d844731a2e4de32882c820116c28126ec328",
      "start": 12.02,
      "end": 14.554,
      "sourceText": "我想休息一下，喝杯水。",
      "sourcePinyin": "Wǒ xiǎng xiūxi yíxià, hē bēi shuǐ."
    },
    {
      "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l03:text1:line5",
      "kind": "lines",
      "track": "course-assets/hsk2/audio/3-1.mp3",
      "sourceHash": "a5266364b94e2f1164829ca370f4d844731a2e4de32882c820116c28126ec328",
      "start": 15.236,
      "end": 15.942,
      "sourceText": "好的。",
      "sourcePinyin": "Hǎo de."
    },
    {
      "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l03:text2:line1",
      "kind": "lines",
      "track": "course-assets/hsk2/audio/3-3.mp3",
      "sourceHash": "fd0e17876c95c7e19c2ba00b3ef85f139f753c842a4d8f39a91993f0ea54e0d3",
      "start": 0.846,
      "end": 3.778,
      "sourceText": "我们找个时间去旅游，怎么样？",
      "sourcePinyin": "Wǒmen zhǎo ge shíjiān qù lǚyóu, zěnmeyàng?"
    },
    {
      "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l03:text2:line2",
      "kind": "lines",
      "track": "course-assets/hsk2/audio/3-3.mp3",
      "sourceHash": "fd0e17876c95c7e19c2ba00b3ef85f139f753c842a4d8f39a91993f0ea54e0d3",
      "start": 5.064,
      "end": 8.332,
      "sourceText": "好啊，我也很想一起出去玩。",
      "sourcePinyin": "Hǎo a, wǒ yě hěn xiǎng yìqǐ chūqù wán."
    },
    {
      "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l03:text2:line3",
      "kind": "lines",
      "track": "course-assets/hsk2/audio/3-3.mp3",
      "sourceHash": "fd0e17876c95c7e19c2ba00b3ef85f139f753c842a4d8f39a91993f0ea54e0d3",
      "start": 9.756,
      "end": 10.98,
      "sourceText": "你想去哪儿？",
      "sourcePinyin": "Nǐ xiǎng qù nǎr?"
    },
    {
      "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l03:text2:line4",
      "kind": "lines",
      "track": "course-assets/hsk2/audio/3-3.mp3",
      "sourceHash": "fd0e17876c95c7e19c2ba00b3ef85f139f753c842a4d8f39a91993f0ea54e0d3",
      "start": 12.332,
      "end": 13.755,
      "sourceText": "我还没想好呢。",
      "sourcePinyin": "Wǒ hái méi xiǎnghǎo ne."
    },
    {
      "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l03:text2:line5",
      "kind": "lines",
      "track": "course-assets/hsk2/audio/3-3.mp3",
      "sourceHash": "fd0e17876c95c7e19c2ba00b3ef85f139f753c842a4d8f39a91993f0ea54e0d3",
      "start": 15.164,
      "end": 19.19,
      "sourceText": "那你再想一想，你想好了，我来买票。",
      "sourcePinyin": "Nà nǐ zài xiǎng yi xiǎng, nǐ xiǎnghǎo le, wǒ lái mǎi piào."
    },
    {
      "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l03:text3:line1",
      "kind": "lines",
      "track": "course-assets/hsk2/audio/3-5.mp3",
      "sourceHash": "e707a7657c521dce8e96e3be45c9aea84e36b7cad52be95d8ce7e30391b8f60a",
      "start": 1.244,
      "end": 4.022,
      "sourceText": "吃个苹果吧，我都洗好了。",
      "sourcePinyin": "Chī ge píngguǒ ba, wǒ dōu xǐhǎo le."
    },
    {
      "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l03:text3:line2",
      "kind": "lines",
      "track": "course-assets/hsk2/audio/3-5.mp3",
      "sourceHash": "e707a7657c521dce8e96e3be45c9aea84e36b7cad52be95d8ce7e30391b8f60a",
      "start": 5.267,
      "end": 5.944,
      "sourceText": "好的。",
      "sourcePinyin": "Hǎo de."
    },
    {
      "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l03:text3:line3",
      "kind": "lines",
      "track": "course-assets/hsk2/audio/3-5.mp3",
      "sourceHash": "e707a7657c521dce8e96e3be45c9aea84e36b7cad52be95d8ce7e30391b8f60a",
      "start": 7.215,
      "end": 9.804,
      "sourceText": "就在桌子上，你自己拿。",
      "sourcePinyin": "Jiù zài zhuōzi shang, nǐ zìjǐ ná."
    },
    {
      "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l03:text3:line4",
      "kind": "lines",
      "track": "course-assets/hsk2/audio/3-5.mp3",
      "sourceHash": "e707a7657c521dce8e96e3be45c9aea84e36b7cad52be95d8ce7e30391b8f60a",
      "start": 11.219,
      "end": 17.112,
      "sourceText": "我去洗洗手。对了，我们去西安旅游，怎么样？",
      "sourcePinyin": "Wǒ qù xǐxi shǒu. Duìle, wǒmen qù Xī'ān lǚyóu, zěnmeyàng?"
    },
    {
      "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l03:text3:line5",
      "kind": "lines",
      "track": "course-assets/hsk2/audio/3-5.mp3",
      "sourceHash": "e707a7657c521dce8e96e3be45c9aea84e36b7cad52be95d8ce7e30391b8f60a",
      "start": 18.688,
      "end": 20.482,
      "sourceText": "为什么想去西安？",
      "sourcePinyin": "Wèi shénme xiǎng qù Xī'ān?"
    },
    {
      "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l03:text3:line6",
      "kind": "lines",
      "track": "course-assets/hsk2/audio/3-5.mp3",
      "sourceHash": "e707a7657c521dce8e96e3be45c9aea84e36b7cad52be95d8ce7e30391b8f60a",
      "start": 22.103,
      "end": 26.781,
      "sourceText": "我看了看网上的介绍，这个时候去西安很不错！",
      "sourcePinyin": "Wǒ kànle kàn wǎngshang de jièshào, zhège shíhou qù Xī'ān hěn búcuò!"
    },
    {
      "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l03:text4:line1",
      "kind": "lines",
      "track": "course-assets/hsk2/audio/3-7.mp3",
      "sourceHash": "65f54630e7973c0bbf2791d0b0d3de97b1ea7d06ab869b109edacbe51ba125d4",
      "start": 0.718,
      "end": 15.455,
      "sourceText": "早上，刘明开车送孩子去学校，送完孩子回家后，医院就来电话了，让他回去上班。我觉得他这个月每天都很累，真想让他休息休息。",
      "sourcePinyin": "Zǎoshang, Liú Míng kāichē sòng háizi qù xuéxiào, sòngwán háizi huí jiā hòu, yīyuàn jiù lái diànhuà le, ràng tā huíqù shàngbān. Wǒ juéde tā zhège yuè měi tiān dōu hěn lèi, zhēn xiǎng ràng tā xiūxi xiūxi."
    },
    {
      "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l02:text1:line5:sentence1",
      "kind": "subsegments",
      "track": "course-assets/hsk2/audio/2-1.mp3",
      "sourceHash": "6d065977c6e53de14a9c542ccc007b05513607d1ddf915eb8ddab89761ac31e3",
      "start": 12.707,
      "end": 13.531,
      "sourceText": "谢谢。",
      "sourcePinyin": "Xièxie."
    },
    {
      "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l02:text1:line5:sentence2",
      "kind": "subsegments",
      "track": "course-assets/hsk2/audio/2-1.mp3",
      "sourceHash": "6d065977c6e53de14a9c542ccc007b05513607d1ddf915eb8ddab89761ac31e3",
      "start": 14.06,
      "end": 16.668,
      "sourceText": "安妮，我们还是打车去吧。",
      "sourcePinyin": "Ānnī, wǒmen háishi dǎchē qù ba."
    },
    {
      "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l02:text3:line4:sentence1",
      "kind": "subsegments",
      "track": "course-assets/hsk2/audio/2-5.mp3",
      "sourceHash": "9ad1cb08fdbc7201ebf19f3241c3dd81e38cc5786bdf45a525cfce91c7b434ea",
      "start": 13.315,
      "end": 14.118,
      "sourceText": "天啊！",
      "sourcePinyin": "Tiān a!"
    },
    {
      "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l02:text3:line4:sentence2",
      "kind": "subsegments",
      "track": "course-assets/hsk2/audio/2-5.mp3",
      "sourceHash": "9ad1cb08fdbc7201ebf19f3241c3dd81e38cc5786bdf45a525cfce91c7b434ea",
      "start": 14.4,
      "end": 16.622,
      "sourceText": "有的还不到二十块钱。",
      "sourcePinyin": "Yǒude hái bú dào èrshí kuài qián."
    },
    {
      "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l02:text4:line1:sentence1",
      "kind": "subsegments",
      "track": "course-assets/hsk2/audio/2-7.mp3",
      "sourceHash": "d15ac004b92205234b2a65134628a1e58426386cffcb067fc5a0a244d9824c8f",
      "start": 0.788,
      "end": 4.229,
      "sourceText": "北京大学很大，有四万多名学生。",
      "sourcePinyin": "Běijīng Dàxué hěn dà, yǒu sìwàn duō míng xuésheng."
    },
    {
      "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l02:text4:line1:sentence2",
      "kind": "subsegments",
      "track": "course-assets/hsk2/audio/2-7.mp3",
      "sourceHash": "d15ac004b92205234b2a65134628a1e58426386cffcb067fc5a0a244d9824c8f",
      "start": 4.857,
      "end": 14.665,
      "sourceText": "学校很漂亮，里边还有家电影院，电影票也不贵，我们有时间还想再过来看个电影。",
      "sourcePinyin": "Xuéxiào hěn piàoliang, lǐbian hái yǒu jiā diànyǐngyuàn, diànyǐngpiào yě bú guì, wǒmen yǒu shíjiān hái xiǎng zài guòlái kàn ge diànyǐng."
    },
    {
      "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l03:text3:line4:sentence1",
      "kind": "subsegments",
      "track": "course-assets/hsk2/audio/3-5.mp3",
      "sourceHash": "e707a7657c521dce8e96e3be45c9aea84e36b7cad52be95d8ce7e30391b8f60a",
      "start": 11.219,
      "end": 12.497,
      "sourceText": "我去洗洗手。",
      "sourcePinyin": "Wǒ qù xǐxi shǒu."
    },
    {
      "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l03:text3:line4:sentence2",
      "kind": "subsegments",
      "track": "course-assets/hsk2/audio/3-5.mp3",
      "sourceHash": "e707a7657c521dce8e96e3be45c9aea84e36b7cad52be95d8ce7e30391b8f60a",
      "start": 13.601,
      "end": 17.112,
      "sourceText": "对了，我们去西安旅游，怎么样？",
      "sourcePinyin": "Duìle, wǒmen qù Xī'ān lǚyóu, zěnmeyàng?"
    },
    {
      "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l03:text4:line1:sentence1",
      "kind": "subsegments",
      "track": "course-assets/hsk2/audio/3-7.mp3",
      "sourceHash": "65f54630e7973c0bbf2791d0b0d3de97b1ea7d06ab869b109edacbe51ba125d4",
      "start": 0.718,
      "end": 9.825,
      "sourceText": "早上，刘明开车送孩子去学校，送完孩子回家后，医院就来电话了，让他回去上班。",
      "sourcePinyin": "Zǎoshang, Liú Míng kāichē sòng háizi qù xuéxiào, sòngwán háizi huí jiā hòu, yīyuàn jiù lái diànhuà le, ràng tā huíqù shàngbān."
    },
    {
      "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l03:text4:line1:sentence2",
      "kind": "subsegments",
      "track": "course-assets/hsk2/audio/3-7.mp3",
      "sourceHash": "65f54630e7973c0bbf2791d0b0d3de97b1ea7d06ab869b109edacbe51ba125d4",
      "start": 10.815,
      "end": 15.455,
      "sourceText": "我觉得他这个月每天都很累，真想让他休息休息。",
      "sourcePinyin": "Wǒ juéde tā zhège yuè měi tiān dōu hěn lèi, zhēn xiǎng ràng tā xiūxi xiūxi."
    }
  ]
}
